'''Suppressing Fire''' is a [[debuff]] applied on hit by the {{il|Barrage}} attack of [[Plumed Chimeral]]s. It slows the cast and ranged attack speeds of the affected target.

Monster that use Suppressing Fire, may have the mod {{ml|MonsterSuppressingFire}}.
